###### Debian 12 (Bookworm) Build and Deployment Instruction ########
1. cd kmailio (parent directory of `src` directory
2. make cfg include_modules="presence"
3. make modules
4. cp src/modules/presence/presence.so /usr/lib/x86_64-linux-gnu/kamailio/modules/.
